activitytrack-web (0.9.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Versions and compatibility (docs/SYNC.md §12): wire schema 1, the server
    speaks it and the two before; 426 for an app outside the window; each
    phone's app version kept current; the policy editor warns of phones
    that would refuse a policy.
  * Two-step login: authenticator app (TOTP) or email code, recovery codes,
    required by the organisation for admins, managers or everyone.
  * Content-Security-Policy on every page.
  * The server's version in the menu and on the login page.

